        "Title": "SMALLTOWN BOY",
        "Location": "LOCATION_COLOMBIA",
        "PublicId": "112402286941",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/colombia/scene_hippo.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 086451c9-214f-46e8-80f4-f6614ed9f7ad).Image",
        "Description": "You leave in the morning with everything you own in a little black case.\r\rAlone on the platform the wind and the rain on a sad and lonely face.\r\rMother will never understand why you had to leave.\r\rFor the answers you seek will never be found at home.\r\rFor the love that you need will never be found at home.\r----------\rYou were the one that they&apos;d talk about around town as they put you down.\r\rAnd as hard as they would try they&apos;d hurt to make you cry.\r\rBut you&apos;d never cry to them just to your soul.",
